    "text": "Gabby Skopec wins 10-mile at ScoCo50 on Aug. 29, 2026\nBy\nB. E. AtkinsGabby Skopec won the 10-mile event at ScoCo50 on Aug. 29, 2026, finishing in 1:09:33, according to RunSignUp results.\nSkopec, listed as being from Coralville, Iowa, was the top female finisher.\nAndrew Hermiston was the fastest male finisher at 1:12:29.\nAndrew Hermiston placed second in 1:12:29, and Brian Ward finished third in 1:21:43.",
